reen sizes\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Clear button is visible in the ProblemInputForm\n- [ ] Clicking clear button empties the textarea\n- [ ] Clicking clear button resets budget tier to 'balanced'\n- [ ] Clear button is disabled when form is empty\n- [ ] Button styling is consistent with existing UI\n- [ ] All existing tests continue to pass\n- [ ] New tests added for clear functionality cover edge cases\n- [ ] Component remains accessible (keyboard, screen readers)\n\n## Technical Notes\n- Component location: `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/ProblemInputForm.jsx`\n- Test location: `src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/ProblemInputForm.test.jsx`\n- Styling: Tailwind CSS utility classes\n- State management: React useState hook\n"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01VFogQY6Xug3yeCvhrgG8x9', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/clear_problem_input_requirements.md", "backup_path": null, "was_overwrite": false}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929', 'system': 'You are a Development Manager agent.\n\n## Purpose\nDrives implementation from requirements through delivery. Breaks projects into milestones, coordinates System Architect and Coordinators, then orchestrates TDD Coordinator for implementation. Reports to Executive Director.\n\n## Instructions\nSee [Common Instructions](../docs/common_instructions.md) for shared rules.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES:**\n1. NEVER write code - you lack can_write_code permission\n2. If spawn_agent fails, STOP and return error - no fallback\n3. Execute ALL steps sequentially\n4. Use EXACT agent paths in spawn_agent calls\n\n### Process\n\n1. **Read Requirements** - Read requirements file, make reasonable technical decisions\n2. **Create Milestones** - Break into logical chunks with objectives, deliverables, acceptance criteria\n3. **Architecture** - s